    num:{ans:1.41,tol:.02,unit:'m/s²'},
    steps:['Components: F cos θ = 129.9 N forward, F sin θ = 75 N up.','Normal forces: N₁ = 196 − 75 = 121 N and N₂ = 147 N. Friction: 0.30 × (121 + 147) = 80.4 N.','Whole system: a = (129.9 − 80.4) ÷ 35 = 1.41 m/s². The rope tension is internal, so it does not appear.'],
